{
  "info": {
    "name": "LeadForge API",
    "description": "Complete API collection for LeadForge — a queue-driven lead discovery, enrichment, scoring, and export platform.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. **Import** this collection into Postman\n2. **Set `baseUrl`** variable (default: `http://localhost:8000`)\n3. **Run Register** to create a test user\n4. **Run Login** — the auth token is automatically stored as `{{authToken}}`\n5. **Create a search job** to kick off discovery\n6. **Monitor via Health & Scrapers** endpoints\n7. **Browse leads & businesses** as they populate\n8. **Export data** when ready\n\n## Architecture\n\n```\nSearch Job → Discovery Worker → Website Worker → Contact Worker → Social Worker → Scoring Worker → Export\n```\n\nAll endpoints under `/api/v1` require JWT Bearer token auth except `/health`, `/health/scrapers`, `/metrics`, and scraper `/health` & `/metrics`.\nAdmin endpoints require `ADMIN` role (update user role in DB: `UPDATE users SET role = 'ADMIN' WHERE email = '...';`).\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n| Variable | Default | Description |\n|---|---|---|\n| `baseUrl` | `http://localhost:8000` | API base URL |\n| `authToken` | (auto) | JWT token set by Login/Register |\n| `userId` | (auto) | Current user ID |\n| `searchJobId` | (manual) | ID of a search job |\n| `businessId` | (manual) | ID of a business/lead |\n| `exportId` | (manual) | ID of an export |\n| `profileId` | (manual) | ID of a social profile |",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "leadforge"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "authToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "searchJobId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "businessId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "exportId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "profileId", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
